- preserve `ID_POLIGONO`; target is `RENDIMIENTO_T_HA`;
- source evidence under `data/source/`, `docs/official/` and `docs/reference/` is immutable;
- stable reusable code belongs in `src/geocebada/`; notebooks are exploratory;
