## Checkpoint 04A implementation status

04A code/config/tests are now committed. It is designed to produce:

- geographic target-to-train and train-LOO neighbors;
- transductive PCA neighborhoods for C0 base, C1 agronomic and all deterministic features;
- monthly 2025 temporal similarity using 11 sensor/index trajectories, including lag and DTW;
- all labeled-labeled pair comparisons against absolute yield difference;
